- if `!st.mouseOn` → «ЛКМ/ПКМ: приложение мышь не включило» (but the pad's main function is scrolling, so the hint should stay about scrolling). I'll put the mouse-mode state ONLY in the button tooltips + a `.dim` class, and keep the pad hint about scrolling. Plus `title` on the buttons. Hmm, but "the user complained about dead buttons" → a visible hint is better. Let me add a small status line at the top of the bar? No room.

